### ==============================================================================
### AGRIMAN INVENTORY MANAGEMENT HTTP TEST SUITE (Part 2 - Kalyan kumar vanumu)
### Stock Movements Engine: Live Directory, Stock In, Stock Out, Stock Transfer
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5147
@contentType = application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. LIVE STOCK DIRECTORY (Missing Read APIs)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 GET Live Stock Directory with Pagination, Search & Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory?search=fertilizer&categoryId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 1.2 GET Stock Breakdown across all Storage Locations for a Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/1/stock
Accept: {{contentType}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. STOCK IN (GET & POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 GET Stock In History (with date, product, location, and supplier filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-in?productId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&supplierId=5&fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.2 POST Stock In - Valid Incoming Delivery (Auto-generates SIN-YYYY-NNN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-in
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 50.0,
  "unitPrice": 1450.00,
  "supplierId": 5,
  "supplierName": "Sri Rama Agro Chemicals",
  "referenceType": "Purchase",
  "notes": "50 bags of Urea received in prime condition"
}

### 2.3 POST Stock In - Validation Test (Non-existent Product ID returns 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-in
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 999999,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 10.0,
  "unitPrice": 500.00,
  "notes": "Should return 404 Not Found"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. STOCK OUT (GET & POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 GET Stock Out History (with date, product, location, farm/crop filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-out?productId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&farmId=2&cropId=1&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3.2 POST Stock Out - Valid Issue to Field (Auto-generates SOUT-YYYY-NNN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-out
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 15.0,
  "farmId": 2,
  "cropId": 1,
  "issuedTo": "Ramesh (Tractor Operator)",
  "purpose": "First Basal Dressing for Cotton Season",
  "referenceType": "FieldUsage",
  "notes": "Applied across 5 acres"
}

### 3.3 POST Stock Out - Strict Insufficient Stock Test (Returns 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-out
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 999999.0,
  "farmId": 2,
  "cropId": 1,
  "issuedTo": "Test Operator",
  "purpose": "Excessive request test",
  "notes": "Should trigger strict insufficient-stock validation error"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. STOCK TRANSFER (GET & POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 GET Stock Transfer History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-transfer?productId=1&fromLocation=Main%20Warehouse&toLocation=North%20Farm%20Shed&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4.2 POST Stock Transfer - Valid Transfer (Generates Paired STR-OUT & STR-IN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-transfer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "toLocation": "North Farm Shed",
  "quantity": 10.0,
  "notes": "Dispatched for urgent spraying in North Field"
}

### 4.3 POST Stock Transfer - Validation Test: Identical Locations (Returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-transfer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "toLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 5.0,
  "notes": "Should return 400 Bad Request: Locations cannot be identical"
}


### ==============================================================================
### PART 3: STOCK ADJUSTMENTS, LEDGER, LOW STOCK & ANALYTICS (Chandana Paparao)
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 GET Stock Adjustment History (Default pagination: Page 1, Size 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.2 GET Stock Adjustment History with Filters (ProductId & Location)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment?productId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.3 GET Stock Adjustment History with Date Range Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment?fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.4 POST Stock Adjustment - Decrease (Variance computed automatically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "physicalStock": 115.0,
  "reason": "Quarterly physical stock audit count (damaged bags)",
  "approvedBy": "Chandana Paparao (Warehouse Manager)",
  "remarks": "Discrepancy reconciled during quarterly physical audit"
}

### 5.5 POST Stock Adjustment - Increase
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "physicalStock": 125.0,
  "reason": "Found unrecorded returned goods in bin A4",
  "approvedBy": "Chandana Paparao (Warehouse Manager)",
  "remarks": "Added surplus back to inventory"
}

### 5.6 POST Stock Adjustment - Validation Test (Non-Existent Product ID returns 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 99999,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "physicalStock": 50.0,
  "reason": "Invalid product ID validation test",
  "approvedBy": "QA Auditor"
}

### 5.7 POST Stock Adjustment - Validation Test (Negative Physical Stock returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-adjustment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "physicalStock": -10.0,
  "reason": "Negative stock validation test",
  "approvedBy": "QA Auditor"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. ENHANCED STOCK LEDGER & CSV EXPORT
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 GET Stock Ledger (All transactions, paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/ledger?page=1&pageSize=15
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6.2 GET Stock Ledger Filtered by Transaction Type (Adjustment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/ledger?transactionType=Adjustment&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6.3 GET Stock Ledger Filtered by Search Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/ledger?search=Urea&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6.4 GET Stock Ledger CSV Export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/ledger/export
Accept: text/csv

### 6.5 GET Stock Ledger CSV Export Filtered
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/ledger/export?transactionType=Adjustment
Accept: text/csv


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. LOW STOCK ALERTS & EXECUTIVE INVENTORY SUMMARY
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 GET Low Stock Alerts with Calculated Deficit and Estimated Reorder Cost
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/low-stock
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7.2 GET Low Stock Alerts with Location and Category Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/low-stock?location=Main%20Warehouse&categoryId=1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7.3 GET Executive Inventory Summary & Valuation Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/summary
Accept: {{contentType}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. PLATFORM INTEGRATION VERIFICATION (Dashboard & TotalData)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 GET Dashboard Summary (Wired with lowStockCount and inventoryValuation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Dashboard/summary
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 8.2 GET Dashboard Low Stock Items Widget (Live threshold calculations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Dashboard/low-stock-items
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 8.3 GET Total Platform Data Summary (Wired with totalInventoryValuation and lowStockItemsCount)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/total-data/summary
Accept: {{contentType}}

